    "description": "Add the standard Files related list to both objects. This is the one documented exception to the dynamic-pages rule.\n\n=== IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS ===\n\n* Files is not available as a Dynamic Related List. Kobi: 'This is one of those older components. I don't think it's supported by the lightning version yet.' So it goes on the classic page layout.\n\n* Add it to all three Account page layouts. Kobi live: 'there's three layouts, right? So I just added to all three of them just to be sure.'\n\n* Keep it on Operator even though its only known file (Pitch & Positioning) moved to Deal — Kobi: 'it doesn't hurt to have a file section for the operator anyways. It doesn't really cost anything.' Joyce: 'Okay, yep.'\n\n=== OPEN QUESTIONS ===\n\n* This layout-driven component is less customisable than the rest of the page. Kobi: 'This one is not going to be as customizable as the others... we can deal with that after.' Anything actually needed there, or leave it?\n\n=== NOTES ===\n\n* ALREADY BUILT — added live on Aug 17 across all three layouts. Ticket is retroactive documentation.\n\n* Combined OP-12 and PT-13 — identical, smallest card in the batch.\n\n=== SOURCE ===\n\n* Taryn doc OP-12 + PT-13\n\n* Aug 13 call\n\n* Aug 17 call — classic layout, all three\n\nDependencies: None\n\nOwner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n\nRemember to update the requirements documentation as part of this change.\n\nCreated 2026-08-17 from the Operator/Partner ticket review, approved by Kobi.",
